      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 5.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Afternoon, thanks for coming in. Is it your first time here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.51,
      "end_seconds": 13.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "No, uh, I came last year for something else."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.64,
      "end_seconds": 17.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.44,
      "end_seconds": 34.86,
      "duration_seconds": 16.42,
      "text": "Um, so... a red hot swelling on my leg. That's why I came. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.15,
      "end_seconds": 39.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.03,
      "end_seconds": 50.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "Uh, I'm on gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day. Though honestly, some days I forget to take it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.45,
      "end_seconds": 60.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.44,
      "end_seconds": 79.95,
      "duration_seconds": 17.51,
      "text": "Mostly severe. Honestly, a few times a day. And a high fever, too. Oh, and pain much worse than it looks. With pain much worse than it looks, it's on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.29,
      "end_seconds": 85.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Okay, did you get cut or insect bite?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.36,
      "end_seconds": 90.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "No, no cut or insect bite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.04,
      "end_seconds": 93.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.47,
      "end_seconds": 96.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.51,
      "end_seconds": 99.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.99,
      "end_seconds": 103.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Erm, no problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.83,
      "end_seconds": 106.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.02,
      "end_seconds": 110.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.34,
      "end_seconds": 112.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.35,
      "end_seconds": 118.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.99,
      "end_seconds": 121.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.06,
      "end_seconds": 125.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.92,
      "end_seconds": 143.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.23,
      "end_seconds": 147.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Diabetes, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.94,
      "end_seconds": 158.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Ah. Alright, diabetes, that matches what I have here. Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.93,
      "end_seconds": 164.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 173.07,
      "end_seconds": 183.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse 100, blood pressure 125 over 75, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, temp 39.1 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.81,
      "end_seconds": 185.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.07,
      "end_seconds": 191.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.63,
      "end_seconds": 211.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.97,
      "end_seconds": 215.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.82,
      "end_seconds": 239.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "The skin on your leg is dusky with blisters and is very tender, and you are feverish."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.79,
      "end_seconds": 255.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.12,
      "end_seconds": 260.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Um, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.57,
      "end_seconds": 276.65,
      "duration_seconds": 15.08,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review, but I'd like to confirm. An urgent surgical review is what I'd like next, for possible necrotising infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.38,
      "end_seconds": 279.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.67,
      "end_seconds": 298.05,
      "duration_seconds": 17.38,
      "text": "Urgent blood tests is what I'd like next, for severe skin infection. I am sending you to hospital now, do not wait. One warning sign to remember: you cannot go now. In that case don't wait. I'd like you back straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.66,
      "end_seconds": 301.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.49,
      "end_seconds": 306.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.76,
      "end_seconds": 311.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.59,
      "end_seconds": 315.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
